## License

MIT

Some of the data was extracted manually or automatically from wiki.vg and minecraft.gamepedia.com.
If required by one of the sources the license might change to something more appropriate.

----- END VERBATIM upstream README.md §License -----

The "MIT" identifier is the SPDX short identifier for the MIT License
(https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT.html). Upstream's README does not reproduce
the full MIT text — for the canonical text see
https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT.

This vendored copy includes only the JSON data files listed in
VERSION.txt; no upstream source code is vendored. The data files are
factual measurements of in-game Minecraft behaviour (block names, light
values, biome tints, etc.); the licence covers our redistribution of
that derived data under PrismarineJS's MIT terms.
